WEBVTT

00:00:00.820 --> 00:00:04.943
Hi, I'm Tilly! Let's change how tuios looks.

00:00:06.193 --> 00:00:08.033
The theme picker is one palette search away.

00:00:08.942 --> 00:00:13.662
There are over 340 themes. The arrows preview each one live.

00:00:14.299 --> 00:00:15.659
Enter keeps the one you like.

00:00:16.453 --> 00:00:20.933
Control B, then comma, opens a settings page for every option.

00:00:21.510 --> 00:00:24.630
Changes show at once, and they're saved to your config file.

00:00:28.000 --> 00:00:30.640
Want to try it? The install guide is right here.
